    <h1>25 Limericks About People Named Bill</h1>

    <div class="limerick">
        <p>There once was a fellow named Bill,</p>
        <p>Who tried to pay every bill.</p>
        <p>He'd write a check,</p>
        <p>With a nervous neck,</p>
        <p>And hope that the bank would be still.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="limerick">
        <p>A bill named Bill loved to cook,</p>
        <p>He'd read every cookbook.</p>
        <p>He'd burn the rice,</p>
        <p>Not once, but twice,</p>
        <p>Then blame it on the stove's book.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="limerick">
        <p>Bill the economist tried to explain,</p>
        <p>Why inflation was causing pain.</p>
        <p>He'd draw a chart,</p>
        <p>With a broken heart,</p>
        <p>And say, "It's all due to rain."</p>
    </div>

    <div class="limerick">
        <p>There was Bill who loved Jurgen's song,</p>
        <p>He'd sing it all day long.</p>
        <p>With a loud voice,</p>
        <p>He'd make noise,</p>
        <p>And annoy everyone strong.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="limerick">
        <p>A bill named Bill went to sea,</p>
        <p>He'd sail with great glee.</p>
        <p>He'd lose his hat,</p>
        <p>And that was that,</p>
        <p>Then swim back to land with a plea.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="limerick">
        <p>Bill the economist tried to save,</p>
        <p>From a financial grave.</p>
        <p>He'd buy stocks,</p>
        <p>With broken locks,</p>
        <p>And dig himself a deeper cave.</p>
    </div>

